{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30563","headline":"除歙州途中寄座主王侍郎 · 卢肇","name":"除歙州途中寄座主王侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忝专城奉六条，自怜出谷屡迁乔。\n驱车虽道还家近，捧日惟愁去国遥。\n朱户昨经新棨戟，风帆常觉恋箪瓢。\n江天夜夜知消息，长见台星在碧霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}